      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p data-visibility=\"gm\"><strong>Trigger</strong> The golem takes electricity damage and a creature is adjacent to it.</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The golem lashes out and tries to grab a nearby creature. The golem attempts an Athletics check to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.PMbdMWc2QroouFGD]{Grapple} an adjacent creature. The creature also takes [[/r 3d6[electricity]]] damage on a success, or [[/r 6d6[electricity]]] damage on a critical success.</p>"
